WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
A local HTTP server sends the same picture in two formats.

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000
The smaller JPEG completes first; the original PNG is still transferring.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.500
These are real local requests with deliberately paced chunks.

00:09.500 --> 00:12.000
This controlled demonstration is not a public-network benchmark.
